---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use & Disclaimer | WCE CGPA to Percentage Calculator"
  description="Terms of service, academic disclaimer, and usage rules for the WCE CGPA to Percentage Calculator."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-binance-card border border-binance-yellow/30 text-xs font-mono text-binance-yellow">
        <span>Terms & Conditions</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">
        Terms of Use & <span class="text-binance-yellow">Disclaimer</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-binance-muted">Effective Date: Academic Year 2023-24</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-binance-card rounded-2xl border border-binance-border p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 text-xs font-mono text-binance-text leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">1. Academic Calculation Accuracy</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          This calculator implements the official conversion formula specified in Section 16 of the Walchand College of Engineering, Sangli Academic and Examination Rules and Regulations 2023-24: <code class="text-white bg-binance-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-binance-border">Percentage = (10.00 × CGPA) − 7.50</code>. While every attempt is made to mirror institutional rules verbatim, this tool is an independent digital helper and does not replace official grade cards or college transcripts issued by the Controller of Examinations (COE), WCE Sangli.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">2. Official Verification Recommendation</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          Students submitting credentials for recruitment, visa processing, GATE/MPSC applications, or foreign higher education should always attach their official WCE Grade Cards and institutional CGPA-to-Percentage Equivalence Certificate issued by WCE Sangli.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">3. Intellectual Property & Trademarks</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          "Walchand College of Engineering", "WCE", and associated institute crests belong exclusively to Walchand College of Engineering, Sangli. This web application is an educational community utility and is not officially sponsored by or legally affiliated with WCE administration.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-binance-yellow">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted">
          The developers of this software cannot be held liable for discrepancies arising from candidate misentry, browser rounding nuances, or retrospective rule amendments enacted by academic bodies.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
